    narr:narration """The thread runs from [a blanket pre-frost commitment to install humidity sensors across all four bays](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_1) into [a prioritized pilot sequence that puts the first unit in the bay with the worst seedling losses last winter](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_2), closed by [a bare assent](narr:Expr_20261009_2_Batch1Greenhouse20261009050853_hf6ea0fc7e73d_3).""" ;
